scripts/timezones.json contains the timezone names exported from Go 1.25's
bundled IANA timezone database. It contains names only, not transition data.

internal/matching/regex_unicode.mbt contains fixed Unicode 15.0.0 category and script ranges
exported from Go's unicode package by scripts/generate_regex_unicode.go.
internal/model/quote_unicode.mbt contains Go Unicode 15.0.0 IsPrint ranges
exported by scripts/generate_quote_unicode.go.
internal/template/template_float.mbt adapts the exact decimal conversion,
rounding and formatting approach from Go strconv/decimal.go and strconv/ftoa.go.
